      "description": "The signature module: forest bar with title left and one link right, joined to a paper panel.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-section\"><div class=\"ds-bar\"><div class=\"ds-bar-title\"><h2>Today at Larkmoor</h2><span class=\"ds-bar-sub\">Thursday 10 September</span></div><a class=\"ds-bar-link\" href=\"#\">This week&rsquo;s calendar <svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"ds-panel\"><p>10:00 Chair yoga with Rosa, Garden Room. 2:00 Music with the Millbrook Ukulele Club, Common Room.</p><p class=\"ds-panel-foot\"><span class=\"ds-stamp\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span>Updated today, 6:55 am</span><span>Every activity is open to family members.</span></p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{width:1.15em;height:1.15em;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none}.ds-section{font-family:var(--font-body,\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#1e2a26);max-width:720px}.ds-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 24px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--forest,#1f4d3b);color:#fff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}.ds-bar-title{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-bar h2{font-family:var(--font-display,\"Bricolage Grotesque\",\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0;color:#fff}.ds-bar h2::before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:var(--apricot,#e8834a);border-radius:2px;margin-right:12px;vertical-align:2px}.ds-bar-sub{color:#cfe3d9;font-size:17px}.ds-bar-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-color:var(--apricot-light,#f6b283);min-height:44px}.ds-bar-link:hover{color:var(--apricot-light,#f6b283)}.ds-bar-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}.ds-panel{background:var(--paper,#fff);border:1px solid var(--rule,#e2dcd1);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:22px 24px}.ds-panel p{margin:0 0 1em;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55}.ds-panel-foot{display:flex;gap:10px 22px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:14px 0 0!important;font-size:17px!important;color:var(--ink-2,#4a5753)}.ds-stamp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink-2,#4a5753);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule,#e2dcd1);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 13px}.ds-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#1e9a55;flex:none}"
