      "description": "Fixed demonstration control outside the site chrome; the switch turns structure mode on.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pill\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Demonstration controls\"><span class=\"ds-pill-tag\">Demo</span><button class=\"ds-switch\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Module structure shown</span></button><a class=\"ds-pill-link\" href=\"#\">What is this?</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--violet-line,#9a92dd);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px 6px 8px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(30,42,38,.06),0 12px 28px -12px rgba(30,42,38,.18);font-family:var(--font-body,\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:17px}.ds-pill-tag{background:var(--violet,#4338a6);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px}.ds-switch{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;color:var(--violet,#4338a6);background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;min-height:40px;padding:0 4px}.ds-track{width:44px;height:26px;border-radius:999px;background:#c9c6d9;position:relative;transition:background .25s;flex:none}.ds-track::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] .ds-track{background:var(--violet,#4338a6)}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] .ds-track::after{transform:translateX(18px)}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--violet,#4338a6);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}.ds-pill-link{color:var(--violet,#4338a6);font-weight:700;padding:0 4px;min-height:40px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}"
